    "questions": [
      {"id":"L10-M01","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"relative-molecular-mass","question":"H₂O的相对分子质量是？","options":["16","17","18","32"],"answer":2,"explanation":"H₂O的相对分子质量=1×2+16=18。","knowledgeIds":["relative-molecular-mass"]},
      {"id":"L10-M02","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"mass-ratio","question":"CO₂中碳元素和氧元素的质量比是？","options":["1:1","1:2","3:8","12:16"],"answer":2,"explanation":"CO₂中C:O质量比=12:(16×2)=12:32=3:8。","knowledgeIds":["mass-ratio"]},
      {"id":"L10-M03","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction","question":"CaCO₃中钙元素的质量分数是？","options":["20%","30%","40%","50%"],"answer":2,"explanation":"CaCO₃相对分子质量=100，钙元素质量分数=40/100×100%=40%。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction"]},
      {"id":"L10-M04","type":"concept","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"化学反应前后，一定不变的是？","options":["分子种类","原子种类","物质种类","分子数目"],"answer":1,"explanation":"质量守恒的微观本质：化学反应前后原子的种类、数目、质量都不变。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M05","type":"concept","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"下列现象能用质量守恒定律解释的是？","options":["水结冰后质量不变","铁生锈后质量增加","酒精挥发后质量减少","玻璃破碎后质量不变"],"answer":1,"explanation":"铁生锈是化学变化，能用质量守恒定律解释。其他都是物理变化。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M06","type":"calculation","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"relative-molecular-mass","question":"H₂SO₄的相对分子质量是？","options":["96","98","100","110"],"answer":1,"explanation":"H₂SO₄的相对分子质量=1×2+32+16×4=98。","knowledgeIds":["relative-molecular-mass"]},
      {"id":"L10-M07","type":"calculation","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction","question":"50g CaCO₃中钙元素的质量约为？","options":["10g","20g","40g","50g"],"answer":1,"explanation":"CaCO₃中钙元素质量分数=40/100=40%，50g中含钙20g。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction"]},
      {"id":"L10-M08","type":"calculation","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"mass-ratio","question":"NH₄NO₃中氮、氢、氧元素的质量比是？","options":["2:4:3","14:2:24","7:1:12","7:1:8"],"answer":2,"explanation":"N:H:O质量比=(14×2):(1×4):(16×3)=28:4:48=7:1:12。","knowledgeIds":["mass-ratio"]},
      {"id":"L10-M09","type":"concept","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"化学反应前后，一定发生改变的是？","options":["原子种类","原子数目","物质种类","元素种类"],"answer":2,"explanation":"化学反应生成新物质，物质种类一定改变。原子种类、数目、元素种类都不变。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M10","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"stoichiometry","question":"10g碳酸钙完全分解，生成二氧化碳的质量约为？","options":["4.4g","5.6g","10g","18g"],"answer":0,"explanation":"CaCO₃→CaO+CO₂↑，100g碳酸钙生成44g二氧化碳，10g生成4.4g。","knowledgeIds":["stoichiometry","law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M11","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"relative-molecular-mass","question":"Fe₂O₃的相对分子质量是？","options":["72","112","160","232"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Fe₂O₃的相对分子质量=56×2+16×3=112+48=160。","knowledgeIds":["relative-molecular-mass"]},
      {"id":"L10-M12","type":"concept","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"下列关于质量守恒定律的说法正确的是？","options":["10g水变成10g水蒸气符合质量守恒定律","镁条燃烧后固体质量增加，不符合质量守恒定律","化学反应前后原子种类和数目不变","质量守恒定律适用于所有变化"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A是物理变化；B中增加的质量来自氧气，总质量守恒；D只适用于化学变化。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M13","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction","question":"100g NH₄NO₃中氮元素的质量约为？","options":["14g","28g","35g","80g"],"answer":1,"explanation":"NH₄NO₃中氮元素质量分数=(14×2)/80×100%=35%，100g中含氮35g。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction"]},
      {"id":"L10-M14","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"relative-molecular-mass","question":"KMnO₄的相对分子质量是？","options":["118","158","174","186"],"answer":1,"explanation":"KMnO₄的相对分子质量=39+55+16×4=39+55+64=158。","knowledgeIds":["relative-molecular-mass"]},
      {"id":"L10-M15","type":"concept","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"蜡烛燃烧后质量减少，是否能用质量守恒定律解释？","options":["不能，因为质量减少了","能，生成的CO₂和H₂O逸散到空气中","不能，蜡烛燃烧不是化学变化","能，但只能解释部分现象"],"answer":1,"explanation":"蜡烛燃烧生成CO₂和H₂O气体逸散，总质量守恒，只是没有称量到所有生成物。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M16","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"mass-ratio","question":"H₂O中氢元素和氧元素的质量比是？","options":["1:8","2:1","1:16","8:1"],"answer":0,"explanation":"H₂O中H:O质量比=(1×2):16=2:16=1:8。","knowledgeIds":["mass-ratio"]},
      {"id":"L10-M17","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction","question":"SO₃中硫元素的质量分数约为？","options":["20%","30%","40%","50%"],"answer":2,"explanation":"SO₃相对分子质量=32+16×3=80，硫元素质量分数=32/80×100%=40%。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction"]},
      {"id":"L10-M18","type":"concept","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"镁条在空气中燃烧，反应前后物质的总质量是否相等？","options":["不相等，因为镁条燃烧后质量增加","相等，因为参加反应的镁和氧气的质量总和等于生成的氧化镁的质量","不相等，因为燃烧产生了光能","相等，但镁条质量不变"],"answer":1,"explanation":"质量守恒定律：参加反应的镁和氧气的质量总和等于生成的氧化镁的质量。固体质量增加是因为结合了氧气。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M19","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"relative-molecular-mass","question":"Ca(OH)₂的相对分子质量是？","options":["74","78","80","84"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Ca(OH)₂的相对分子质量=40+(16+1)×2=40+34=74。","knowledgeIds":["relative-molecular-mass"]},
      {"id":"L10-M20","type":"constructed","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"stoichiometry","question":"某同学将24g镁条在空气中完全燃烧，生成氧化镁的质量是多少？（已知Mg相对原子质量24，O为16）","rubric":{"modelAnswer":"2Mg+O₂→2MgO。设生成MgO质量为x。24:48=24g:x，x=40g。或：24g Mg为1mol，生成1mol MgO，质量为40g。","keywords":[["化学方程式","2Mg+O₂→2MgO"],["比例计算","质量关系"],["结果","40g"]],"explanation":"根据化学方程式，24g镁完全燃烧生成40g氧化镁，增加的质量16g来自空气中的氧气。"},"explanation":"2Mg+O₂→2MgO，24g镁生成40g氧化镁，增加16g氧。","knowledgeIds":["stoichiometry","law-conservation"],"misconceptionIds":["mc-law-conservation"]},
      {"id":"L10-M21","type":"single","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"law-conservation","question":"下列叙述中，符合质量守恒定律的是？","options":["10g水结成10g冰","10g水受热变成10g水蒸气","10g氢气与10g氧气完全反应生成20g水","5g硫与5g氧气完全反应生成10g二氧化硫"],"answer":3,"explanation":"A、B是物理变化；C中氢气与氧气按1:8质量比反应，10g+10g不能恰好完全反应；D中硫与氧气按1:1质量比反应，5g+5g恰好完全反应生成10g SO₂。","knowledgeIds":["law-conservation","stoichiometry"]}
    ],
